WEBVTT

01:46.400 --> 01:46.880
Wu!

01:47.759 --> 01:48.240
Dude!

01:48.640 --> 01:49.840
Guess what?

01:51.120 --> 01:52.080
I'm moving back to Beijing!

02:03.600 --> 02:04.160
Congrats.

02:05.240 --> 02:06.560
Glad you're escaping this place.

02:07.080 --> 02:07.960
Right back at you.

02:08.840 --> 02:09.400
No more

02:09.560 --> 02:11.160
dealing with me!

02:32.000 --> 02:32.440
Here he is.

02:32.640 --> 02:33.240
Yup.

02:42.960 --> 02:43.520
Ride's here.

02:44.280 --> 02:44.680
Let's roll.

02:46.760 --> 02:47.600
Talk about

02:47.600 --> 02:48.840
making an entrance!

02:49.079 --> 02:50.120
Beats a tuk-tuk,

02:50.240 --> 02:50.880
more space than

02:50.880 --> 02:51.360
an SUV.

02:51.640 --> 02:53.160
Courtesy of Kyle's dad.

02:53.800 --> 02:55.960
Five-star service here.

03:00.120 --> 03:01.360
Auntie, Grandma,

03:01.880 --> 03:02.680
take care.

03:03.320 --> 03:04.080
If you get lonely

03:04.080 --> 03:05.240
during dinner,

03:05.360 --> 03:06.920
just FaceTime me.

03:07.440 --> 03:07.840
OK.

03:08.680 --> 03:10.280
Just focus on school, dear.

03:10.640 --> 03:11.960
We'll be fine.

03:13.440 --> 03:14.080
Sweetie,

03:15.360 --> 03:16.320
look...

03:16.360 --> 03:18.000
Sorry if I haven't been

03:18.040 --> 03:19.320
the best company lately.

03:20.440 --> 03:21.840
You've got big things ahead,

03:22.120 --> 03:23.880
abroad and all.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.120
I'm not gonna

03:25.120 --> 03:27.160
play the "stay here"

03:27.160 --> 03:27.960
card.

03:28.160 --> 03:29.600
I'd hate to hold you back.

03:31.160 --> 03:32.240
Relax, Auntie.

03:32.440 --> 03:33.800
You'll get your money.

03:35.640 --> 03:36.400
Um...

03:37.680 --> 03:38.200
No, no!

03:38.400 --> 03:40.600
I loved having you here.

03:40.720 --> 03:42.720
It wasn't just for the money.

03:43.120 --> 03:44.720
And you didn't stay till the end...

03:44.920 --> 03:46.000
please,

03:46.240 --> 03:47.320
just forget

03:47.640 --> 03:48.840
the money!

03:49.680 --> 03:50.440
You're getting it!

03:50.760 --> 03:51.880
Mr. Sun will handle the details.

03:56.600 --> 03:57.320
Ye!

03:58.040 --> 03:58.720
Ye!

03:59.280 --> 03:59.800
Ye!

04:00.200 --> 04:00.680
Ye!

04:01.080 --> 04:01.440
Here.

04:02.720 --> 04:03.120
What's this?

04:03.280 --> 04:03.800
Good stuff!

04:04.280 --> 04:05.720
Real, high-end avocados and cherries.

04:05.760 --> 04:07.680
No knock-offs,

04:07.880 --> 04:08.360
seriously.

04:08.880 --> 04:09.520
For the road!

04:09.920 --> 04:11.160
My mom made these.

04:11.360 --> 04:12.240
They're your favorites.

04:12.440 --> 04:13.400
Go ahead.

04:14.800 --> 04:15.320
You guys...

04:15.880 --> 04:16.959
Just take them!

04:17.040 --> 04:17.440
Yeah.

04:18.240 --> 04:18.959
Wow, this is heavy.

04:18.959 --> 04:19.720
I've got it.

04:19.920 --> 04:20.399
Come on.

04:20.959 --> 04:22.760
It's such a long trip.

04:22.960 --> 04:24.080
You'll need

04:24.160 --> 04:24.680
to eat.

04:25.880 --> 04:26.560
Thanks, guys.

04:27.040 --> 04:27.400
Let's get going.

04:27.840 --> 04:28.440
Bye, everyone.

04:28.680 --> 04:29.280
Take care.

04:29.360 --> 04:29.840
Let's go.

04:30.640 --> 04:31.440
- Stay safe!
- Let's roll!

04:31.520 --> 04:32.080
See ya!

04:32.120 --> 04:33.240
Travel safe, sweetie.

04:33.240 --> 04:33.640
See ya!

04:35.200 --> 04:35.640
Go on now.

04:36.080 --> 04:36.520
Bye!

04:36.720 --> 04:37.360
Bye!

04:37.360 --> 04:38.360
Bye-bye!

04:38.360 --> 04:39.320
Bye, Auntie, Grandma!

04:39.320 --> 04:40.040
See ya!

04:40.440 --> 04:41.440
Safe trip!

04:54.560 --> 04:55.120
Pull over,

04:55.320 --> 04:55.880
please.

05:01.440 --> 05:02.400
I just want one last look.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.280
Remember

05:32.280 --> 05:33.560
the day we met?

05:43.360 --> 05:44.920
[Hey, gorgeous!]

05:45.640 --> 05:46.800
[Get lost!]

05:50.360 --> 05:51.120
You were a feisty one.

05:54.280 --> 05:55.320
I'm leaving!

05:55.920 --> 05:57.159
Can't you be nice?

06:00.040 --> 06:00.840
Just being real.

06:09.360 --> 06:10.360
You were standing

06:11.280 --> 06:12.320
right there,

06:12.920 --> 06:14.320
thinking I was a total

06:15.080 --> 06:15.720
hillbilly.

06:18.360 --> 06:18.960
Actually...

06:20.080 --> 06:21.120
it was "asshole."

06:24.240 --> 06:25.840
Turns out my first impression

06:25.960 --> 06:26.720
was right.

06:32.600 --> 06:33.880
Everyone else had

06:34.840 --> 06:35.520
a proper goodbye.

06:35.520 --> 06:36.280
What about you?

06:50.680 --> 06:51.320
Like what?

06:54.120 --> 06:54.880
I'll probably

06:54.880 --> 06:56.280
never be back.

06:57.520 --> 06:58.720
As a farewell,

06:59.200 --> 07:00.280
isn't there something you wanna say?

07:04.680 --> 07:05.720
It's not like

07:06.440 --> 07:07.320
you're going to the moon.

07:09.800 --> 07:10.760
I was

07:11.320 --> 07:12.520
hoping for a

07:13.000 --> 07:14.040
"see you again."

07:17.600 --> 07:18.720
It's not like you're

07:18.720 --> 07:20.000
cutting ties for good.

07:24.440 --> 07:25.080
Duh, dummy.

07:28.080 --> 07:29.120
You hated this place

07:29.880 --> 07:30.920
when you first got here,

07:30.920 --> 07:31.840
didn't you?

07:34.159 --> 07:35.640
I felt like my world was ending.

07:37.320 --> 07:38.680
It was written

07:39.400 --> 07:40.159
all over your face.

07:41.560 --> 07:42.440
Was I that easy to read?

07:43.040 --> 07:44.720
You were a total powder keg.

07:45.600 --> 07:47.000
I thought you'd blow up any second.

07:49.520 --> 07:50.680
So you were

07:51.760 --> 07:53.080
keeping tabs on me, huh?

08:09.280 --> 08:09.800
Stop here.

08:10.360 --> 08:10.800
OK.

08:29.440 --> 08:30.960
Lavender is stunning

08:30.960 --> 08:31.800
up close.

08:33.799 --> 08:35.360
Whoa, they're gorgeous!

08:35.640 --> 08:36.360
Amazing!

08:37.960 --> 08:38.720
Yeah?

08:39.120 --> 08:40.159
You've seen it a hundred times.

08:43.240 --> 08:43.919
Yeah, right,

08:44.360 --> 08:45.160
it's medicinal too:

08:45.800 --> 08:47.760
clears heat,

08:48.000 --> 08:49.080
stops itching,

08:49.360 --> 08:51.560
makes great tea...

08:52.000 --> 08:52.760
And...

08:53.120 --> 08:54.080
[And for soothing your restless,]

08:54.320 --> 08:55.120
[anxious little head.]

08:55.680 --> 08:56.880
Yeah,

08:57.160 --> 08:58.080
"soothing the nerves!"

08:58.880 --> 08:59.560
Good memory.

09:00.040 --> 09:00.680
I try.

09:07.880 --> 09:08.600
Take a photo of me

09:08.880 --> 09:10.720
before I go, alright?

10:05.680 --> 10:06.560
Are you even taking it?

10:06.960 --> 10:07.520
What're you smirking about?

10:08.800 --> 10:09.600
Yeah, yeah,

10:09.720 --> 10:10.160
got it!

10:24.360 --> 10:24.880
Hey...

10:25.720 --> 10:26.120
Wu,

10:28.640 --> 10:29.640
since I'm leaving,

10:30.320 --> 10:31.400
let's take one together.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.240
I'm really bad in photos.

10:37.080 --> 10:38.240
Just for the memory!

10:38.280 --> 10:38.960
C'mon!

10:48.720 --> 10:49.800
C'mon, crack a smile!

10:55.160 --> 10:57.080
3, 2, 1...

11:04.040 --> 11:05.640
[I thought I was trapped.]

11:06.640 --> 11:07.920
[I never imagined this place]

11:08.160 --> 11:09.760
[would become a sanctuary,]

11:10.960 --> 11:12.560
[where every breeze whispered]

11:13.160 --> 11:14.160
[the true meaning]

11:14.160 --> 11:15.160
[of life]

11:16.280 --> 11:17.960
[and gave me the courage to start over.]

11:40.400 --> 11:40.840
Go on.

11:42.440 --> 11:42.960
Thanks.

11:44.440 --> 11:45.200
Safe travels.

11:47.720 --> 11:48.280
How about...

11:49.240 --> 11:49.880
a hug?

12:12.600 --> 12:13.800
Whoa, you're being pretty sweet.

12:14.680 --> 12:15.560
Not used to this.

12:16.520 --> 12:17.000
Don't worry.

12:17.040 --> 12:18.360
You won't have to be.

12:20.600 --> 12:21.440
It's over

12:21.840 --> 12:22.600
for good.

12:24.360 --> 12:24.800
Goodbye.

13:12.840 --> 13:14.360
[Beijing, I'm coming!]

13:14.840 --> 13:15.760
[Guys, see you soon!]

13:37.120 --> 13:38.280
A video?

13:38.280 --> 13:39.880
I asked for photos.

14:10.560 --> 14:11.280
[I'm here!]

14:11.600 --> 14:12.720
[Your place]

14:13.160 --> 14:14.640
[or eat out?]

14:38.440 --> 14:39.200
Yes?

14:39.560 --> 14:40.600
Ms. Qing Ye?

14:41.360 --> 14:42.960
This is GlobEd.

14:44.000 --> 14:44.640
There's an issue

14:44.640 --> 14:45.960
with your application.

14:46.200 --> 14:47.560
You need to come in;

14:48.160 --> 14:49.800
the school needs to speak with you.

14:50.480 --> 14:51.480
On my way.

15:00.680 --> 15:02.440
You're a top candidate,

15:02.880 --> 15:03.600
but the school

15:03.640 --> 15:04.960
is pulling your offer.

15:06.600 --> 15:07.160
Why?

15:07.280 --> 15:08.040
We received

15:08.040 --> 15:09.320
an anonymous report

15:09.320 --> 15:10.160
about your family.

15:13.240 --> 15:14.520
Someone reported me?

15:14.560 --> 15:15.080
Yes.

15:15.520 --> 15:17.080
Unfortunately, you didn't disclose

15:17.120 --> 15:18.280
your father's

15:18.280 --> 15:19.360
ongoing financial investigations

15:19.400 --> 15:20.960
and frozen assets.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.200
Therefore,

15:22.360 --> 15:23.400
your candidacy

15:23.400 --> 15:24.200
has been revoked,

15:24.520 --> 15:25.720
and you are ineligible

15:25.800 --> 15:26.880
to apply for the next

15:26.880 --> 15:27.520
five years.

15:28.840 --> 15:29.760
Sorry.

15:35.720 --> 15:36.160
Please,

15:36.440 --> 15:36.960
right this way.

15:37.640 --> 15:38.800
Two avocado smoothies,

15:39.080 --> 15:39.440
please.

15:39.440 --> 15:39.840
Alright.

15:42.680 --> 15:43.120
Welcome.

15:43.920 --> 15:44.880
Where are you?

15:45.080 --> 15:45.680
I've got

15:45.680 --> 15:46.720
your favorite smoothie.

15:58.040 --> 15:58.680
Qing Ye?

15:59.840 --> 16:00.680
What a surprise!

16:03.080 --> 16:04.360
Ruihang invited me.

16:05.760 --> 16:06.200
Oh!

16:06.400 --> 16:07.520
You're finally back.

16:07.520 --> 16:08.760
We wanted to throw you a party.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.240
Quitting the group,

16:11.440 --> 16:12.320
ghosting my texts,

16:12.560 --> 16:13.760
and blocking me on socials,

16:14.440 --> 16:15.200
that's your idea

16:15.200 --> 16:16.000
of a party?

16:21.520 --> 16:22.640
You snitched on me, right?

16:27.240 --> 16:27.880
You've

16:28.240 --> 16:29.080
always been sharp.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.400
I knew you'd catch on.

16:32.800 --> 16:33.800
And all that

16:34.440 --> 16:36.360
"come stay at my place" talk?

16:37.720 --> 16:38.320
You never

16:38.320 --> 16:39.360
wanted me back.

16:42.880 --> 16:43.520
Why?

16:45.800 --> 16:46.960
Because of Ruihang?

16:48.520 --> 16:50.000
You're not oblivious.

16:50.560 --> 16:52.000
You've just been playing dumb.

16:52.680 --> 16:53.440
You knew I liked him...

16:54.160 --> 16:55.560
but he only had eyes for you.

16:56.040 --> 16:57.520
I wasn't playing dumb.

16:58.840 --> 17:00.520
I just didn't give a damn!

17:02.280 --> 17:03.040
We're through.

17:03.840 --> 17:05.240
We aren't friends anymore.

17:06.640 --> 17:07.319
We were never

17:07.319 --> 17:08.359
friends to begin with.

17:08.359 --> 17:08.960
He Leling.

17:10.079 --> 17:10.640
Ruihang...

17:14.440 --> 17:15.319
That's outrageous!

17:23.200 --> 17:23.760
Come in.

17:29.920 --> 17:30.840
Slippers.

17:31.120 --> 17:32.040
Your old pair.

17:33.720 --> 17:34.280
Thanks.

17:34.920 --> 17:35.840
Sure.

17:38.200 --> 17:38.720
Look...

17:39.200 --> 17:40.960
I'm just here for a minute.

17:41.240 --> 17:41.840
I'll

17:41.960 --> 17:43.120
find a hotel soon.

17:43.880 --> 17:45.160
There's no way

17:45.240 --> 17:46.520
I'm letting you stay in a hotel.

17:46.960 --> 17:47.600
I'll have the housekeeper

17:47.600 --> 17:48.560
prep the guest room.

17:48.680 --> 17:49.400
Just settle in.

17:54.560 --> 17:55.000
Come on in.

17:56.560 --> 17:57.040
I'll take that.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.160
Ye?

18:10.880 --> 18:11.520
Mrs. Meng.

18:12.360 --> 18:12.720
Er...

18:13.440 --> 18:13.840
Mom,

18:14.080 --> 18:14.920
she's staying with us

18:14.920 --> 18:16.200
for a while.

18:19.360 --> 18:19.880
Good!

18:20.520 --> 18:21.520
Of course!

18:21.800 --> 18:23.320
C'mon, dear, sit!

18:24.120 --> 18:24.640
C'mon.

18:26.600 --> 18:28.200
You've lost so much weight!

18:29.560 --> 18:30.920
Have some water.

18:32.440 --> 18:33.280
Thanks.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.080
Oh, stop it!

18:35.360 --> 18:36.680
We're practically family!

18:37.040 --> 18:37.800
I've always thought of you

18:37.800 --> 18:38.600
as my own kid.

18:39.280 --> 18:40.720
Make yourself at home!

18:42.520 --> 18:43.040
Hungry?

18:43.800 --> 18:44.440
I'm OK.

18:45.600 --> 18:46.560
Nonsense.

18:46.880 --> 18:48.200
I'll grab you some fruit.

18:48.840 --> 18:49.280
Drink up.

18:49.920 --> 18:50.400
Ruihang,

18:50.560 --> 18:51.760
give me a hand.

18:52.200 --> 18:52.840
I'll be right back.

19:08.080 --> 19:08.920
Are you crazy?

19:09.280 --> 19:10.520
Why did you

19:10.520 --> 19:11.600
bring her here?

19:12.000 --> 19:12.440
What's

19:12.960 --> 19:13.720
the problem?

19:14.720 --> 19:15.800
Your dad

19:15.800 --> 19:16.680
had business

19:16.680 --> 19:17.760
with her family.

19:18.520 --> 19:19.280
If we're not careful,

19:19.280 --> 19:20.680
they'll drag us down too.

19:21.640 --> 19:22.920
Everyone in town

19:23.160 --> 19:24.000
is distancing themselves

19:24.000 --> 19:25.280
from her family.

19:25.760 --> 19:26.400
Mom,

19:26.840 --> 19:27.800
seriously?

19:28.280 --> 19:29.440
Why on earth would we

19:29.440 --> 19:30.280
need to do that?

19:31.800 --> 19:32.920
You're so naive.

19:34.040 --> 19:35.600
I'm looking out for you.

19:36.120 --> 19:37.440
You wanna end up like her?

19:37.520 --> 19:38.280
Homeless,

19:38.600 --> 19:39.960
stuck with some broke relatives

19:39.960 --> 19:40.720
in the sticks?

19:41.920 --> 19:44.040
She needs help.

19:44.080 --> 19:44.840
I'm not gonna

19:44.840 --> 19:46.080
turn my back on her!

19:47.360 --> 19:48.320
Why can't you

19:48.320 --> 19:49.840
just listen to me?

19:50.400 --> 19:51.960
Just get it through your head:

19:52.560 --> 19:54.120
cut ties with her.

19:59.520 --> 20:00.200
Ye,

20:00.600 --> 20:01.320
sweetie!

20:01.320 --> 20:02.400
Your favorite cherries

20:02.400 --> 20:03.200
and avocados.

20:04.000 --> 20:04.520
Where'd she go?

20:05.120 --> 20:05.760
Qing Ye?

20:06.520 --> 20:07.160
She's gone?

20:09.920 --> 20:10.920
Good.

20:14.680 --> 20:15.320
[Sorry,]

20:15.440 --> 20:17.600
[the subscriber you are calling...]

20:18.880 --> 20:19.320
Hey!

20:19.920 --> 20:20.360
Ruihang,

20:21.320 --> 20:21.680
where...

20:23.560 --> 20:24.120
[Honestly...]

20:24.800 --> 20:25.920
[it's not looking good]

20:26.560 --> 20:27.880
[for your dad.]

20:28.640 --> 20:30.120
[The victims are]

20:30.520 --> 20:31.800
[filing a joint lawsuit.]

20:31.800 --> 20:32.680
[The investigation's a nightmare.]

20:33.240 --> 20:35.240
[Everything's still up in the air.]

20:36.040 --> 20:37.200
[But don't lose hope.]

20:37.520 --> 20:39.000
[The legal team]

20:39.800 --> 20:41.840
[is working around the clock]

20:42.000 --> 20:43.120
[to clear his name.]

20:43.800 --> 20:44.680
[What are the odds?]

20:45.360 --> 20:46.840
[Honestly?]

20:47.360 --> 20:48.400
[I can't make any promises]

20:48.560 --> 20:49.920
[until this plays out.]

20:51.720 --> 20:52.360
I get it.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.200
[Are you back in Beijing?]

20:54.880 --> 20:55.800
[Where are you crashing?]

20:56.280 --> 20:57.600
[If you need a place, come to me.]

20:58.040 --> 20:59.120
Thanks, Mr. Sun.

20:59.560 --> 21:01.080
You've already done so much.

21:01.880 --> 21:02.520
[Look,]

21:03.120 --> 21:04.520
[I'll wire you some money.]

21:04.840 --> 21:06.560
[Don't skimp on yourself, OK?]

21:06.760 --> 21:07.640
No, thanks,

21:08.400 --> 21:09.280
really, Mr. Sun.

21:10.680 --> 21:11.440
I'll talk to you later.

22:12.280 --> 22:13.640
[It's pouring, sweetie.]

22:14.800 --> 22:16.880
[Keep your hood up, OK?]

22:17.160 --> 22:18.080
[If you get soaked,]

22:18.080 --> 22:19.200
[you'll catch a cold.]

22:26.960 --> 22:27.440
[Let's go!]

24:07.920 --> 24:09.080
Haven't eaten all day, right?

24:09.800 --> 24:10.600
Have some.

24:14.360 --> 24:15.560
Or hold it to

24:16.200 --> 24:17.040
warm your hands.

24:27.440 --> 24:28.920
Why are you in Beijing?

24:31.640 --> 24:32.640
I found

24:33.560 --> 24:34.680
a loophole

24:35.080 --> 24:35.600
in our deal.

24:45.040 --> 24:45.960
The expiration date

24:46.360 --> 24:47.440
says

24:48.000 --> 24:48.760
the 10th.

24:49.720 --> 24:51.160
I'm still responsible

24:51.720 --> 24:52.360
for you until

24:52.360 --> 24:53.280
the end of the day.

24:57.280 --> 24:58.440
We've got exactly

24:59.320 --> 25:00.240
15 minutes left.

25:04.400 --> 25:05.720
And after that?

25:09.720 --> 25:10.800
You're welcome to

25:11.760 --> 25:12.800
head back to Zhazhating.

25:14.120 --> 25:15.120
Consider my place your place.

25:33.280 --> 25:34.160
Wanna renew?

25:35.160 --> 25:35.960
Effective immediately.

25:42.960 --> 25:43.360
Yes.

25:50.320 --> 25:50.920
But first,

25:51.720 --> 25:52.520
you're going to

25:53.120 --> 25:54.440
my place with me.

25:54.880 --> 25:56.120
How are we

25:56.440 --> 25:57.040
gonna get in?

25:58.760 --> 25:59.520
Trust me.

26:00.040 --> 26:00.800
I'll get us in.

26:11.240 --> 26:13.480
How'd you find my house?

26:13.840 --> 26:14.800
My mom told me.

26:15.040 --> 26:16.400
The code is changed.

26:16.640 --> 26:17.440
Let's head to the back.

26:18.080 --> 26:19.440
Why didn't you do that earlier?

26:19.800 --> 26:20.680
Slipped my mind...

26:31.320 --> 26:31.880
Over here.

26:44.920 --> 26:47.080
Everything's dead.

26:48.160 --> 26:48.760
Yeah.

26:49.640 --> 26:50.840
Nobody's looked after

26:51.040 --> 26:52.040
the place since

26:52.480 --> 26:53.520
Dad got in trouble.

26:54.120 --> 26:55.280
Were these all your mom's?

26:56.360 --> 26:57.440
She loved gardening.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.040
I actually wanted to

27:00.040 --> 27:01.000
bring some along.

27:01.680 --> 27:02.640
Guess that's a bust.

27:09.280 --> 27:09.720
Look!

27:09.920 --> 27:11.120
Is this one still alive?

27:12.520 --> 27:12.880
Let me see.

27:14.000 --> 27:14.680
It's still green.

27:15.600 --> 27:15.960
Yeah!

27:16.520 --> 27:17.720
A Welwitschia! Still alive!

27:18.640 --> 27:19.160
A what?

27:20.840 --> 27:22.320
It's tough as nails.

27:22.720 --> 27:23.640
Can survive

27:23.640 --> 27:24.520
in the desert for ages.

27:24.800 --> 27:25.560
Seems pretty resilient.

27:26.200 --> 27:27.200
Perfect for Zhazhating.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.520
That's the one.

27:32.000 --> 27:32.520
Let's head in!

27:42.400 --> 27:42.920
Come in.

28:02.640 --> 28:03.400
Man...

28:03.760 --> 28:04.880
it's like a freezer in here.

28:05.160 --> 28:05.840
What?

28:06.440 --> 28:08.360
Never seen central AC before?

28:10.680 --> 28:11.840
Ah, home sweet home!

28:37.720 --> 28:39.440
All these awards...

28:40.000 --> 28:40.800
are yours?

28:42.440 --> 28:43.320
Just stuff

28:43.320 --> 28:44.360
from competitions.

28:50.880 --> 28:51.240
Ah!

28:56.920 --> 28:58.080
Dude,

28:58.560 --> 28:59.160
come here!

29:04.760 --> 29:05.200
Ta-da!

29:07.360 --> 29:08.760
Better polish these off now.

29:08.960 --> 29:10.400
No more fancy ice cream after this.

29:12.960 --> 29:13.360
Let's rock!

29:23.760 --> 29:24.960
So? Is it good?

29:26.160 --> 29:26.680
Amazing!

29:29.400 --> 29:29.840
Wait!

29:30.240 --> 29:31.400
You gotta try this one.

29:32.520 --> 29:33.640
It's the best.

29:35.040 --> 29:35.520
Well?

29:36.440 --> 29:36.960
What do you think?

29:38.440 --> 29:39.040
It's even better!

29:39.920 --> 29:40.520
Here, have a bite.

29:44.560 --> 29:45.440
This is killer!

29:47.040 --> 29:48.040
Here, try this.

29:48.360 --> 29:49.680
It's my top pick.

29:51.160 --> 29:51.880
The favorite, huh?

29:52.240 --> 29:52.800
What is it?

29:54.120 --> 29:54.920
Cookies & Cream.

29:56.600 --> 29:57.080
Like it?

29:57.200 --> 29:58.120
Cookies & Cream...

30:00.880 --> 30:01.400
Awesome.

30:03.880 --> 30:04.760
Consider yourself

30:05.360 --> 30:06.840
part of my summer!

30:13.200 --> 30:13.640
Cheers!

30:14.760 --> 30:15.160
Cheers!

30:44.400 --> 30:45.360
Need a hand?

30:46.760 --> 30:47.200
Grab my

30:47.320 --> 30:48.800
skincare and all that stuff

30:48.800 --> 30:49.920
from the bathroom.

30:50.000 --> 30:50.400
On it.

30:59.840 --> 31:00.960
Got'em all right here.

31:01.520 --> 31:01.960
Let's see...

31:02.920 --> 31:04.280
Yep, all here!

31:04.400 --> 31:04.800
Cool.

31:10.920 --> 31:11.520
Hey,

31:12.320 --> 31:13.880
my childhood savings.

31:14.160 --> 31:15.120
There's probably a ton in there.

31:15.360 --> 31:16.680
Crack it open for me?

31:19.600 --> 31:20.520
Want me to smash it?

31:20.880 --> 31:21.360
Go for it.

31:28.680 --> 31:29.880
Holy, look at all this!

31:35.200 --> 31:36.080
More here, c'mon!

31:36.520 --> 31:37.080
Gimme, gimme!

31:40.520 --> 31:41.400
Wear these.

31:41.880 --> 31:42.280
OK.

31:43.120 --> 31:43.560
Oh,

31:44.200 --> 31:44.960
put this on.

31:45.040 --> 31:45.440
Sure.

31:45.600 --> 31:46.600
It's too bulky.

31:47.160 --> 31:48.960
C'mon, c'mon!

31:49.600 --> 31:50.360
Move, move!

31:53.000 --> 31:53.560
This way!

31:59.120 --> 31:59.600
Hey! Who's there?

32:00.000 --> 32:00.440
Sh*t!

32:01.080 --> 32:01.760
C'mon, this way.

32:02.120 --> 32:02.760
In here.

32:03.720 --> 32:04.680
Stop right there!

32:04.920 --> 32:05.760
Run! Just run!

32:07.440 --> 32:07.920
Hey!

32:08.080 --> 32:09.320
Stop!

32:10.160 --> 32:11.320
C'mon, run!

32:11.360 --> 32:11.880
Wait up!

32:12.200 --> 32:13.280
It's pitch black!

32:13.800 --> 32:15.080
Just wait until the sun comes up!

32:16.360 --> 32:17.040
Stop!

32:18.120 --> 32:18.720
Stop right there!

33:09.160 --> 33:09.720
Oh my god...

33:09.920 --> 33:10.680
Slow down!

33:11.760 --> 33:13.040
My lotion!

33:19.000 --> 33:19.520
Oh man...

33:20.080 --> 33:20.520
d-

33:21.040 --> 33:21.520
did we...

33:22.200 --> 33:23.600
lose them?

33:24.200 --> 33:25.880
Yeah, we lost'em.

33:26.520 --> 33:27.520
Not a soul in sight.

33:29.800 --> 33:30.720
Why were we even running?

33:31.080 --> 33:32.000
Because

33:32.520 --> 33:33.280
the guards chased us?

33:43.360 --> 33:44.040
The sun's up.

33:52.360 --> 33:53.200
Thanks for

33:54.120 --> 33:54.680
everything!

33:59.800 --> 34:00.920
A fresh start.

34:02.080 --> 34:02.840
Come home with me.

34:10.239 --> 34:12.280
There's one place I need to go first.

34:16.400 --> 34:16.840
Lead the way!

34:18.560 --> 34:19.040
Let's go!

34:36.560 --> 34:37.080
Hey, Mom...

34:37.840 --> 34:38.800
I'm here.

34:39.520 --> 34:40.320
Brought you

34:40.320 --> 34:41.600
your favorite soda.

34:41.880 --> 34:43.760
And daisies. You always loved these.

34:46.920 --> 34:47.440
Mom,

34:47.719 --> 34:49.520
it's been a rough ride.

34:51.400 --> 34:52.239
Thought

34:53.960 --> 34:55.639
I hit rock bottom…

34:56.199 --> 34:57.120
but life

34:59.240 --> 35:00.080
found a way

35:01.280 --> 35:02.920
to push me

35:03.800 --> 35:04.920
even lower.

35:09.520 --> 35:10.000
Still,

35:10.560 --> 35:11.680
don't worry.

35:13.600 --> 35:15.200
When I was at my lowest,

35:16.800 --> 35:18.360
someone pulled me back up.

35:19.840 --> 35:21.040
You remember him?

35:21.720 --> 35:23.680
Cousin Xing Wu.

35:24.560 --> 35:25.680
You probably haven't seen him

35:25.720 --> 35:26.440
in years.

35:27.440 --> 35:28.280
He came

35:28.720 --> 35:30.560
all the way here for me.

35:37.120 --> 35:37.680
Hey, Auntie...

35:39.960 --> 35:40.960
I couldn't

35:41.840 --> 35:42.760
bring myself to lie to you.

35:44.120 --> 35:45.440
I was worried about her,

35:46.840 --> 35:47.880
so I came here.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.760
But, honestly...

35:52.640 --> 35:53.040
I...

35:54.320 --> 35:55.640
I can't say

35:56.760 --> 35:58.440
it was entirely for her.

36:01.560 --> 36:02.440
Oh? Then why are you here?

36:12.440 --> 36:13.080
This is our

36:13.360 --> 36:14.880
top-of-the-line model,

36:15.000 --> 36:15.800
and it's brand new!

36:15.920 --> 36:17.560
Waterproof, anti-corrosive,

36:17.560 --> 36:18.560
and foldable.

36:18.720 --> 36:19.360
You're

36:19.360 --> 36:20.240
in luck!

36:20.280 --> 36:20.680
We only take

36:20.680 --> 36:21.800
custom orders

36:21.800 --> 36:23.200
in-store,

36:23.520 --> 36:24.240
and we've got

36:24.280 --> 36:25.120
a promo today.

36:26.720 --> 36:27.520
Sold.

36:27.880 --> 36:28.880
Perfect!

36:29.240 --> 36:30.000
Got a new one?

36:30.520 --> 36:31.000
Definitely.

36:31.080 --> 36:31.680
Right this way.

36:34.680 --> 36:36.120
So, the retail price is

36:36.120 --> 36:37.240
7999.

36:37.360 --> 36:38.800
With the promo...

36:39.520 --> 36:40.520
it's...

36:41.440 --> 36:42.280
6999.

36:42.640 --> 36:43.680
How would you like to pay?

36:44.400 --> 36:45.000
Cash.

36:46.000 --> 36:46.520
Awesome.

36:48.000 --> 36:49.200
Here's 6800.

36:49.520 --> 36:50.200
Can I pay the balance

36:50.520 --> 36:51.280
via app?

36:51.920 --> 36:52.720
You got it.

36:53.000 --> 36:53.720
Let me.

36:58.000 --> 36:58.960
It's for Grandma.

36:59.520 --> 37:00.280
I'd like to chip in.

37:23.360 --> 37:25.440
Smells just like home.

37:29.640 --> 37:30.680
Like it or not,

37:30.680 --> 37:31.360
you're stuck with it now!

37:31.920 --> 37:32.920
I love it.

37:33.200 --> 37:34.200
It's the scent of the ocean.

37:36.200 --> 37:37.040
Everyone will be thrilled

37:37.200 --> 37:38.400
you're back.

37:39.800 --> 37:41.640
Rich, coming from

37:41.960 --> 37:43.080
the guy who told me

37:43.080 --> 37:44.000
to run for good.

37:44.920 --> 37:46.760
I just needed you home

37:46.960 --> 37:47.920
to check on things.

37:48.640 --> 37:49.240
Wu,

37:49.560 --> 37:50.800
since when do you have a cousin?

37:51.160 --> 37:52.080
I've given her a ride before,

37:52.360 --> 37:53.440
but I've never heard your mom mention her.

37:54.000 --> 37:55.360
She's a stray from Beijing.

37:59.120 --> 37:59.520
Here we are.

38:14.880 --> 38:15.640
[Welwitschia...]

38:16.120 --> 38:18.000
[a true desert survivor.]

38:19.280 --> 38:19.920
[Xing Wu,]

38:20.760 --> 38:21.960
[you said]

38:22.440 --> 38:23.400
[roses don't bloom]

38:23.400 --> 38:24.440
[in a wasteland.]

38:25.320 --> 38:26.240
[And you're right.]

38:27.400 --> 38:28.160
[But]

38:28.760 --> 38:30.640
[the desert doesn't nurture the weak.]

38:31.640 --> 38:33.640
[Everything that manages to thrive here...]

38:34.280 --> 38:35.720
[is forged in steel.]

38:37.520 --> 38:39.720
[Zhazhating, I'm home.]

38:44.520 --> 38:45.320
Ye?

38:48.560 --> 38:49.400
Why are you...

38:50.520 --> 38:51.280
back here?

38:52.280 --> 38:53.000
Hey, Auntie...

39:19.160 --> 39:19.640
Here, Auntie.

39:20.120 --> 39:21.000
This is for you.

39:21.240 --> 39:21.880
Try it on!

39:22.120 --> 39:23.080
For me?

39:23.520 --> 39:25.040
I know this brand!

39:26.160 --> 39:28.200
Wow, you can really tell the quality.

39:28.200 --> 39:29.400
It's like

39:29.680 --> 39:31.320
silk against my skin!

39:32.400 --> 39:33.560
And some skincare, too.

39:33.720 --> 39:34.600
It's super hydrating,

39:34.720 --> 39:36.440
perfect for the ocean breeze here.

39:36.840 --> 39:38.080
All for me?

39:38.680 --> 39:40.280
Must've cost a fortune.

39:41.160 --> 39:42.280
It's worth it to see you happy.

39:42.640 --> 39:44.160
I am! I really am!

39:44.640 --> 39:45.040
Grandma,

39:45.520 --> 39:46.440
this is the power switch.

39:46.760 --> 39:48.360
And this is joystick:

39:48.440 --> 39:50.320
forward, back,

39:50.760 --> 39:51.960
and turns.

39:52.200 --> 39:52.840
Now

39:53.040 --> 39:54.240
you can drive yourself over

39:54.280 --> 39:55.680
to visit your friends for coffee.

39:56.120 --> 39:57.320
This is wonderful!

39:57.960 --> 39:58.400
And

39:59.080 --> 40:00.960
souvenir coins from Tiananmen.

40:01.600 --> 40:02.880
She got it just for you.

40:04.200 --> 40:05.440
It's beautiful!

40:06.240 --> 40:07.320
You two

40:07.600 --> 40:09.200
are so sweet!

40:11.560 --> 40:12.040
Hey, I'm so

40:12.040 --> 40:13.520
distracted by the gifts.

40:13.680 --> 40:14.600
Why exactly

40:14.800 --> 40:15.840
are you back?

40:21.680 --> 40:22.520
Plans changed.

40:22.680 --> 40:24.000
She's staying.

40:24.360 --> 40:25.360
Staying?

40:25.520 --> 40:25.840
Yep.

40:26.240 --> 40:27.160
Good.

40:27.680 --> 40:29.600
People act like

40:29.640 --> 40:31.320
the rest of the world

40:31.320 --> 40:32.840
is some kind of gold mine.

40:33.200 --> 40:33.760
Everyone's

40:33.760 --> 40:35.160
rushing to leave,

40:35.520 --> 40:36.120
but home is fine.

40:36.240 --> 40:36.960
Better than fine, actually!

40:38.080 --> 40:38.880
You're right.

40:39.040 --> 40:40.120
That's exactly how I feel.

40:41.040 --> 40:42.080
So, I was wondering...

40:42.680 --> 40:44.400
if I could stay with you all

40:44.400 --> 40:45.800
a bit longer...

40:46.280 --> 40:47.080
Wonderful!

40:47.840 --> 40:49.880
Stay as long as you like,

40:49.920 --> 40:51.360
sweetie.

40:52.200 --> 40:52.880
So...

40:53.240 --> 40:54.440
how long are we talking, exactly?

40:59.160 --> 40:59.680
A year.

41:00.440 --> 41:01.120
A WHAT?

41:02.320 --> 41:02.960
Or maybe two.

41:07.520 --> 41:08.080
You, outside.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.320
We need to talk.

41:12.760 --> 41:13.360
Right now.

41:15.360 --> 41:16.800
You heard me, come on.

41:24.000 --> 41:24.520
Spill it.

41:25.680 --> 41:26.320
What's going on?

41:26.320 --> 41:27.520
Keep it down!

41:33.760 --> 41:34.360
Sweetie,

41:35.840 --> 41:36.520
relax.

41:37.000 --> 41:37.520
Don't worry.

41:39.120 --> 41:40.120
Wu's got this

41:40.640 --> 41:42.200
under control.

41:43.040 --> 41:44.880
Make yourself at home.

41:53.640 --> 41:55.120
She's in a tough spot.

41:55.360 --> 41:56.520
Her family's in ruins.

41:56.960 --> 41:58.080
Snuck into that house for her stuff,

41:58.120 --> 41:59.320
almost got busted.

41:59.960 --> 42:00.520
And...

42:01.080 --> 42:01.560
her study abroad?

42:01.960 --> 42:03.040
Shot to hell.

42:03.160 --> 42:04.040
Her friends

42:04.040 --> 42:04.960
bailed on her.

42:06.280 --> 42:07.040
We're not

42:07.040 --> 42:08.360
really related,

42:08.640 --> 42:09.320
but we

42:09.560 --> 42:10.600
should help,

42:11.080 --> 42:11.520
right?

42:13.280 --> 42:13.920
That sounds

42:13.920 --> 42:15.000
awfully familiar.

42:16.240 --> 42:17.000
Because it's your line.

42:18.160 --> 42:19.080
You actually listened?

42:23.200 --> 42:24.320
And that

42:24.320 --> 42:25.360
Mr. Sun...

42:25.440 --> 42:26.200
He could've

42:26.200 --> 42:28.160
given me

42:28.560 --> 42:29.400
a heads-up.

42:29.400 --> 42:30.760
I'll give

42:31.640 --> 42:32.600
him a call.

42:33.160 --> 42:33.800
- Get back here!
- Hey...

42:34.400 --> 42:34.960
Call him for what?

42:35.080 --> 42:36.800
She still owes me 20k.

42:36.800 --> 42:38.040
What's he gonna do about it?

42:38.200 --> 42:39.960
All their accounts

42:39.960 --> 42:40.720
have been frozen.

42:40.720 --> 42:41.760
Forget the money.

42:42.160 --> 42:43.040
Mr. Sun's just

42:43.040 --> 42:43.720
a subordinate.

42:44.000 --> 42:45.160
Don't bother him for it.

42:45.680 --> 42:47.080
So, let me get this straight.

42:48.880 --> 42:50.520
Not only is that 20k gone,

42:50.880 --> 42:52.400
but we're footing her bill now?

42:53.080 --> 42:53.520
Pretty much.

42:54.200 --> 42:55.600
Look, I'm not just

42:55.680 --> 42:56.920
about the money.

42:56.960 --> 42:57.520
But

42:58.520 --> 42:59.320
what if she stays

42:59.320 --> 43:00.520
a year

43:00.520 --> 43:01.800
or two?

43:02.080 --> 43:03.800
Living expenses, tuition, clothes...

43:04.040 --> 43:05.320
Who's gonna

43:05.320 --> 43:06.200
cover all that?

43:06.520 --> 43:07.240
She already

43:07.240 --> 43:07.960
gave us 30k.

43:08.520 --> 43:08.960
Oh...

43:09.520 --> 43:10.760
You know exactly

43:10.760 --> 43:11.680
where that went.

43:11.680 --> 43:13.560
I used it to pay off debt.

43:14.560 --> 43:14.880
Er...

43:15.080 --> 43:16.680
Rent's due at the end of the month.

43:16.680 --> 43:17.200
I was

43:17.200 --> 43:18.560
counting on that 20k.

43:18.760 --> 43:19.440
What now?

43:21.680 --> 43:22.400
Alright, look.

43:23.560 --> 43:24.240
I'll handle it.

43:27.640 --> 43:28.120
Give me a smile!

43:29.640 --> 43:30.400
I can't.

43:34.680 --> 43:35.960
I said I can't smile!
